description: Minimal, focused code changes — no unrelated edits
globs: **/*.{js,jsx,cjs,sql}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Code Discipline

- Make the smallest possible modification.
- Modify only the functions required by the task.
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
- Do not rewrite entire files.
- Preserve existing formatting, naming, and style.
- Avoid generating unnecessary code.
- A focused 5-line diff that solves the root problem is strictly better than a 100-line diff.
